    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "This revision petition is instituted against the judgment dated 08.04.2009 rendered by Additional Sessions Judge, Panipat, in Criminal Appeal No.9 of 2008 upholding the judgment dated 22.01.2008 and order dated 25.01.2008 rendered by the learned trial Court in Criminal Case No.579/02 of 1999.",
