        },
        {
          "text": "Criminal Case No.579/02 of 1999",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 676,
          "end": 707
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12023015320301056
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The petitioner was convicted and sentenced to undergo simple imprisonment for a period of six months and to pay a fine of Rs.1000/- and in default of payment of fine, to further undergo simple imprisonment for a period of one month for offence under Section 7 punishable under Section 16(1)(a)(i) of the Prevention of Food and Adulteration Act, 1954.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 709,
      "end": 1059,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 7",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 959,
          "end": 968
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 16(1)(a)(i)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 986,
          "end": 1005
        },
        {
          "text": "Prevention of Food and Adulteration Act, 1954",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1013,
          "end": 1058
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5907108783721924
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "2. The case of the prosecution, in a nutshell, is that a complaint was filed by the Government Food Inspector against the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1061,
      "end": 1194,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27196311950683594
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The 1 of 4 petitioner was intercepted in the area of Jattal Road,\nPanipat on 15.05.1999 at 8.30 A.M.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1195,
      "end": 1295,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Panipat",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1261,
          "end": 1268
        },
        {
          "text": "15.05.1999",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1272,
          "end": 1282
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24432648718357086
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "He was found in possession of 15 kgs of cow's milk for human consumption.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1296,
      "end": 1369,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.38768237829208374
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Notice was served upon the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1370,
      "end": 1408,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2625153362751007
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "A sample of 750 mls. was purchased from the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1409,
      "end": 1464,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31531038880348206
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The purchased milk was divided into three equal parts in clean and empty bottles.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1465,
      "end": 1546,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3666743040084839
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Formalin was added as preservative.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1547,
      "end": 1583,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22040006518363953
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Sample was sent for analysis.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1584,
      "end": 1613,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23589067161083221
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "It was found to be adulterated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1614,
      "end": 1645,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37911051511764526
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "In these circumstances, the complaint was filed against the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1646,
      "end": 1717,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3480711281299591
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "He was ordered to be summoned vide order dated 24.08.1999.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1718,
      "end": 1776,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "24.08.1999",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1765,
          "end": 1775
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32667574286460876
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Vinod vs State Of Haryana on 31 May, 2019 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/164846494/\n1 3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1777,
      "end": 1879,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vinod vs State Of Haryana",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1778,
          "end": 1803
        },
        {
          "text": "31 May, 2019",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1807,
          "end": 1819
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33490875363349915
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "The prosecution examined three witnesses in support of his case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1880,
      "end": 1944,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23047283291816711
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Statement of accused was recorded under Section 313 Cr.P.C.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1945,
      "end": 2004,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 313",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1985,
          "end": 1996
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1997,
          "end": 2004
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20262399315834045
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "He denied the case of the prosecution.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2005,
      "end": 2043,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.42438939213752747
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "He was convicted and sentenced by the learned Chief Judicial Magistrate, Panipat, as noticed hereinabove.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2044,
      "end": 2149,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Chief Judicial Magistrate, Panipat",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2090,
          "end": 2124
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.47585809230804443
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "4. The petitioner filed an appeal against the judgment and order of learned Chief Judicial Magistrate, Panipat.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2151,
      "end": 2262,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Chief Judicial Magistrate, Panipat",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2227,
          "end": 2261
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.347610741853714
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "It was dismissed by the learned Additional Sessions Judge, Panipat, vide judgment dated 08.04.2009.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 2263,
      "end": 2362,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Additional Sessions Judge, Panipat",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2295,
          "end": 2329
        },
        {
          "text": "08.04.2009",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2351,
          "end": 2361
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.35739338397979736
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "5. Learned counsel appearing on behalf of the petitioner has vehemently argued that the prosecution has failed to prove the case against the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2364,
      "end": 2516,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14034707844257355
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "6. Learned counsel appearing on behalf of the State has supported the prosecution case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2518,
      "end": 2605,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06984137743711472
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "7. I have heard the learned counsel for the parties and have gone through the judgments and record very carefully.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2607,
      "end": 2721,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "8. PW-1 K.K. Sharma deposed that on 15.05.1999 at 3.30 P.M. he was posted at Government Food Inspector, Panipat.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2722,
      "end": 2835,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "K.K. Sharma",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 2731,
          "end": 2742
        },
        {
          "text": "15.05.1999",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2759,
          "end": 2769
        },
        {
          "text": "Panipat",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2827,
          "end": 2834
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11246195435523987
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "He along with Dr.V.K. Malhotra found the accused carrying 15 kgs. cow's milk for sale.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2836,
      "end": 2922,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "V.K. Malhotra",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2853,
          "end": 2866
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18063756823539734
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "He 2 of 4 purchased milk from the petitioner by serving notice Ex.PA.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2923,
      "end": 2992,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2402981072664261
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "Milk was properly stirred clockwise or anti clockwise.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2993,
      "end": 3047,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23229636251926422
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "Payment was made to the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3048,
      "end": 3083,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20773249864578247
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "He prepared spot memo Ex.PC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3084,
      "end": 3112,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "PC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3109,
          "end": 3111
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10788141936063766
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "Samples were separated from the purchased milk.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3113,
      "end": 3160,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22415558993816376
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "Label Ex.PC/1 was affixed on the bottles.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3161,
      "end": 3202,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1356823891401291
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "These were sealed properly.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3203,
      "end": 3231,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21130849421024323
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "Sample was sent to the Public Analyst, Haryana, Chandigarh.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3232,
      "end": 3291,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Haryana",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3271,
          "end": 3278
        },
        {
          "text": "Chandigarh",
